WEBVTT

00:01:45.066 --> 00:01:46.066
I...

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.030
I believe in Zola!

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:06.873
The Darkness...
It's the dawn of the Darkness!

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.470
Descendants of the Soldiers of Light...
I thank you.

00:02:15.766 --> 00:02:19.866
We shall obtain the Darkness
and return to our rightful forms...

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.870
Hey... You're kidding, right, Zola?!

00:02:23.566 --> 00:02:27.496
She's not kidding.
That was her truth.

00:02:27.966 --> 00:02:31.826
This place will soon be
swallowed up by the Darkness...

00:02:32.933 --> 00:02:36.133
Hey, Zola! Wait, Zola!

00:02:36.233 --> 00:02:41.133
THE TRUTH

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.700
General Logi!
Please respond, General Logi!

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.800
It's no good!
Communications are still down!

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:55.603
But the barrier that was
covering the area is gone!

00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:59.666
Dispatch a reconnaissance unit.
We must find General Logi.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:00.870
Roger!

00:03:18.766 --> 00:03:20.626
Zola...vanished.

00:03:25.266 --> 00:03:26.496
It's growing!

00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:28.026
W-What?!

00:03:28.266 --> 00:03:29.366
Get back, Shu!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.870
General Logi, it's too dangerous!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.670
I don't like this!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.670
What the hell is that, maro?!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.670
Where did Zola go?!

00:03:39.133 --> 00:03:40.973
General Logi, what is this?

00:03:41.733 --> 00:03:42.873
Get back, everyone!

00:03:48.233 --> 00:03:49.233
Get back?

00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:52.426
What's the point of that?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.670
Zola's in there.

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:57.133
The Darkness...

00:03:58.066 --> 00:04:01.196
What's this Darkness, Zola?!

00:04:03.466 --> 00:04:05.966
Blue Dragon, what is this?!

00:04:06.433 --> 00:04:07.433
Like I know.

00:04:08.266 --> 00:04:11.026
But come to think of it,
this does remind me of something...

00:04:11.533 --> 00:04:12.203
Huh?!

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.100
In the ruins.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.700
What's that?!

00:04:25.866 --> 00:04:29.896
Stay alert, Shu!
That thing wants to attack us!

00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:46.396
These things aren't
a challenge at all!

00:04:46.733 --> 00:04:48.903
Shu! What're these things?

00:04:49.233 --> 00:04:51.833
I don't know!
But they're attacking!

00:04:52.533 --> 00:04:54.803
Doesn't seem like
we can reason with them.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.170
General Logi!

00:04:56.433 --> 00:04:59.803
Is that the army of
the Darkness told in legends?

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:03.333
The battle between light and
Darkness in the Book of the Beginning...

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:07.630
The power of the Darkness that was
sealed by the seven Soldiers of Light...

00:05:08.066 --> 00:05:12.196
This must be the place where
the Darkness was sealed.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.570
Is that the true form
of the Darkness?

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.830
General Logi!

00:05:17.966 --> 00:05:18.966
General Logi!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:20.070
Stay back!

00:05:25.933 --> 00:05:26.933
No effect?!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.500
They got turned into the Darkness!

00:05:42.233 --> 00:05:43.903
That's the power of the Darkness?!

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.400
You little!

00:05:54.466 --> 00:05:56.196
They're quickly growing in number.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.470
Everyone, get away from here!

00:06:00.133 --> 00:06:01.533
No!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.800
- Help me!
- Boss Lady!

00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:05.673
Please don't leave me behind!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.800
I don't wanna be turned
into the Darkness, maro!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.600
Retreat!
We're pulling out of here!

00:06:25.133 --> 00:06:25.803
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:06:30.133 --> 00:06:31.273
Retreat!

00:06:45.866 --> 00:06:48.566
Hurry! Hurry up and get away
from here, Phoenix!

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:49.833
Right!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.330
Run away, maro!
Run away, maro!

00:06:56.366 --> 00:06:57.466
I know!

00:06:57.966 --> 00:06:59.266
Give me a lift, too!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.200
Me too, while you're at it!

00:07:07.833 --> 00:07:09.673
General Logi, help!

00:07:10.466 --> 00:07:11.126
Hang on!

00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:13.103
Y-You can't, General Logi!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.370
Please climb on, General Logi!

00:07:20.066 --> 00:07:21.066
This way, quickly!

00:07:32.266 --> 00:07:33.266
General Logi...

00:07:33.533 --> 00:07:36.503
The unidentified area
is slowly expanding.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:41.800
Its rate of expansion is not too fast
but it's growing steadily.

00:07:42.566 --> 00:07:43.896
What about the Extra Seven?

00:07:44.266 --> 00:07:45.826
It's being kept inside this ship.

00:07:46.566 --> 00:07:48.226
What about the Extra Seven?

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.000
The beginning of everything
was the Darkness.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.570
Light is something that
was created afterward.

00:07:57.133 --> 00:08:03.373
I've made the world normal again...
No light or shadow, only the Darkness.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:09.470
The Extra Seven explains how
the Shadows were sealed.

00:08:09.766 --> 00:08:14.766
But if it's related to the Darkness,
there could still be some hidden secrets.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.570
What is our course, General Logi?

00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:20.303
Keep staying on the edge of
the expanding Darkness.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.470
Continue the surveillance.

00:08:25.366 --> 00:08:28.296
Run away, maro!
Run away, maro!

00:08:28.733 --> 00:08:31.873
By the way Marumaro,
how far are we going?

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:36.670
How far?

00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:40.173
And shouldn't we go see
if others are okay?

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.000
Stop, maro!

00:08:43.033 --> 00:08:43.703
Okay.

00:08:48.733 --> 00:08:51.173
That's right, maro.
Calm down, maro.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:55.730
I'll get my thoughts together
as I feel this touch, maro.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.370
Maro...

00:08:58.733 --> 00:09:01.303
What's wrong?!
We're not going to run anymore?

00:09:01.866 --> 00:09:03.026
What're you doing, maro?

00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:07.026
We need to find Kluke and
the others quickly, maro, Saber Tiger!

00:09:07.933 --> 00:09:09.173
Understood.

00:09:11.266 --> 00:09:13.066
Oh, there they are! Over there.

00:09:14.233 --> 00:09:15.233
Hey!

00:09:15.633 --> 00:09:16.873
You guys okay?!

00:09:17.233 --> 00:09:19.733
We're fine, maro!

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:46.230
You guys aren't having any of the fish
we went to the trouble of catching, maro?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.470
It's kind of dark.

00:09:50.033 --> 00:09:51.373
I wonder if it's because
of that Darkness...

00:09:51.833 --> 00:09:53.373
That's not the issue.

00:09:53.933 --> 00:09:54.933
Then what is?

00:09:56.466 --> 00:10:00.496
What...Zola is really after.

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:05.233
So Zola wasn't a descendant of
the Soldiers of Light like us, right?

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:09.800
Did she deceive us like Logi said?

00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:12.596
But if so, since when?

00:10:13.066 --> 00:10:14.066
When?

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:16.230
Was it from when we headed
to the Sealed Grounds

00:10:16.266 --> 00:10:17.666
after we defeated Nene?

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.800
Or was it from when we
were traveling to the ruins

00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:22.573
and deciphering
the Extra Seven?

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.400
Or...

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:25.700
Or...

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.030
Or right from the start?

00:10:31.333 --> 00:10:32.833
W-What?

00:10:33.266 --> 00:10:36.126
You were the first one
to meet Zola...

00:10:36.433 --> 00:10:37.733
That's true.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:43.000
But there was nothing suspicious
about her at all back then...

00:11:04.633 --> 00:11:07.073
Maffei Village was attacked, huh?

00:11:16.233 --> 00:11:18.433
Come with me if you want power.

00:11:19.433 --> 00:11:20.433
What did you say?

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:27.670
This is a Shadow.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.270
A Shadow?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.630
You probably have
the Shadow power as well.

00:11:33.333 --> 00:11:36.773
Come with me if you want to
activate that power.

00:11:37.233 --> 00:11:39.203
I have...power?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:43.970
Come!

00:11:49.966 --> 00:11:54.626
Zola said she was going to defeat Nene.
I'm sure she wasn't lying about that.

00:11:56.233 --> 00:11:57.303
I agree.

00:12:02.166 --> 00:12:03.866
Nene!

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.530
Hornet Assassin!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.000
Zola truly wished to defeat Nene.

00:12:11.666 --> 00:12:14.166
Then Zola changed after that?

00:12:14.566 --> 00:12:15.596
I think so.

00:12:16.433 --> 00:12:17.973
I don't think so.

00:12:18.766 --> 00:12:19.896
Then what?

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:23.900
She didn't deceive us.
There must be some kind of reason.

00:12:24.333 --> 00:12:26.933
She did this with
something in mind.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.800
Logi's men were absorbed by
the Darkness in the Sealed Grounds.

00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:31.726
Is that what she had in mind?

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.700
It must've been a mistake!

00:12:33.933 --> 00:12:36.673
Is that what you guys still think?!

00:12:42.133 --> 00:12:43.233
Delphinium!

00:12:44.933 --> 00:12:46.873
You should be aware
of the fact that

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:48.500
you guys are responsible
for this situation.

00:12:48.666 --> 00:12:49.666
What did you say?!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.430
That woman managed to pull off
something incredible without hesitation...

00:12:54.866 --> 00:12:56.996
Releasing of the Darkness.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.370
You must realize that she was deceiving
you guys from the beginning.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.600
That's a lie!

00:13:02.666 --> 00:13:05.826
Zola said she was a Soldier of Light.

00:13:06.133 --> 00:13:09.033
Now you should know that
she was lying about that.

00:13:10.533 --> 00:13:15.873
The Sealed Grounds activated when all
seven Soldiers of Light were assembled.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:29.500
The Shadows of
the seven Soldiers of Light

00:13:29.533 --> 00:13:35.573
consist of your five Shadows,
Logi's Odin and now my Shadow, Chimera.

00:13:36.533 --> 00:13:40.203
The seven Soldiers of Light were
necessary to release the Darkness.

00:13:41.233 --> 00:13:45.103
She took her measures in order to
assemble those seven people.

00:13:45.466 --> 00:13:50.196
Just a minute. Chimera is Nene's Shadow.
How come you were able to summon it?

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:56.370
Because Chimera's true Shadow Wielder
is Lord Deathroy!

00:13:56.566 --> 00:13:58.066
- What?!
- What?!

00:14:09.866 --> 00:14:13.026
Lord Deathroy can't summon
a Shadow on his own.

00:14:13.933 --> 00:14:16.473
He imparted that power
to Lord Nene.

00:14:16.866 --> 00:14:17.926
He did?

00:14:18.033 --> 00:14:19.333
Something like that?

00:14:19.366 --> 00:14:22.826
So you're saying he's a descendant of
the Soldiers of Light like we are?

00:14:24.466 --> 00:14:26.166
Don't lump him together with you guys!

00:14:26.433 --> 00:14:27.903
Don't! Don't!

00:14:28.066 --> 00:14:29.796
With someone who
got manipulated by Zola,

00:14:29.833 --> 00:14:35.103
defeated Lord Nene and even
helped her release the Darkness!

00:14:35.466 --> 00:14:40.096
Nene was doing evil things.
He brought that on himself!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.830
The world is always
ruled by someone.

00:14:42.933 --> 00:14:44.973
What's wrong with that ruler
being Lord Nene?!

00:14:45.133 --> 00:14:46.873
Nene kidnapped children!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.500
That's right!
And he killed many people!

00:14:49.766 --> 00:14:51.326
What about Zola?!

00:14:51.633 --> 00:14:52.633
Say what?!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.970
Did she care to help
those children and people?!

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.570
What are you talking about?

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:04.000
What?! The village
is being attacked!

00:15:04.766 --> 00:15:07.166
That has nothing to do with us.

00:15:08.166 --> 00:15:09.466
I'm sure she was...

00:15:10.266 --> 00:15:13.266
If her objective was to
unlock the seal and

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.770
release the Darkness
from the beginning,

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.200
then it all makes sense.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:20.530
For that purpose, she had to assemble
the seven Soldiers of Light.

00:15:28.033 --> 00:15:29.033
Of course!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:34.170
All this time I thought all the secrets
were hidden in the Extra Seven.

00:15:34.533 --> 00:15:37.403
But this is only one part of
the Book of the Beginning.

00:15:37.633 --> 00:15:41.233
Both the Book of the Beginning and
the Extra Seven begin with prologues.

00:15:41.733 --> 00:15:43.103
In the Book of the Beginning,

00:15:43.133 --> 00:15:45.603
the Darkness came into being
in the world of light.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:48.230
In the prologue of the Extra Seven,

00:15:48.266 --> 00:15:52.166
the Soldiers of Light vanished
after defeating the Darkness.

00:15:52.666 --> 00:15:54.496
What is the link between them?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.770
There must be a connection between

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:00.170
the other pages of the Extra Seven
and the Book of the Beginning.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:04.100
The Extra Seven itself
could be a key

00:16:04.133 --> 00:16:07.633
to revealing the true meaning
of the Book of the Beginning.

00:16:08.266 --> 00:16:10.226
Let's have the computers
analyze it.

00:16:10.566 --> 00:16:12.426
Both texts have already
been entered.

00:16:12.933 --> 00:16:14.503
We'll get right to work.

00:16:15.633 --> 00:16:17.103
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:16:17.866 --> 00:16:21.266
I fear we will discover that what we
thought was the truth was just a lie,

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:24.500
and we'll face a whole new truth.

00:16:28.233 --> 00:16:30.473
Zola traveled to the Shadow ruins

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:34.200
in search of Shadow Wielders
who were born in that area.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:40.100
Kluke, perhaps your parents
were from Luminas?

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:44.130
If some of you didn't have enough power,
she'd make you fight to get stronger.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.670
Sky Terror!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.470
If some of you hadn't activated
your Shadows yet,

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.070
she'd make you fight
to activate them.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.170
Stop it!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.730
It was all to give the Shadow Wielders
enough power.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:06.100
Then she used you guys
to defeat Lord Nene.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.000
You're lying!

00:17:19.766 --> 00:17:22.196
She had to defeat Lord Nene.

00:17:22.766 --> 00:17:25.566
She had no other choice
in order to capture

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.900
the last Soldier of Light,
Lord Deathroy.

00:17:28.533 --> 00:17:31.503
Then what about Killer Bat?
What's Zola's Shadow?

00:17:31.866 --> 00:17:33.596
Zola's supposed to be
a Shadow Wielder, too.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:38.700
That's right. All of us probably
don't know everything yet.

00:17:39.166 --> 00:17:41.726
Can we really say that only
Zola's the bad guy?

00:17:42.033 --> 00:17:45.473
How can you talk such nonsense with
that growing Darkness before you?!

00:17:52.033 --> 00:17:55.033
General Logi!
Some new text has been deciphered.

00:17:55.566 --> 00:17:56.226
Hmm...

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.600
The Darkness came into being.

00:18:00.333 --> 00:18:02.933
The Soldiers of Light are
shadows of the Darkness.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:04.573
What does that mean?

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.570
I can't tell just with this.

00:18:06.833 --> 00:18:08.803
Please hurry up and finish
deciphering the rest of it.

00:18:09.366 --> 00:18:11.666
We only have so much
processing power here.

00:18:12.266 --> 00:18:14.366
It would be faster if we use
the computers at the base.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:21.530
It seems that the Soldiers of Light
will do something terrible

00:18:21.566 --> 00:18:23.426
if we don't do something about it.

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.570
We must be careful.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:26.670
Yes, sir.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.630
Though nothing will happen
unless I get involved...

00:18:34.933 --> 00:18:38.303
Lord Nene just wanted
to rule this world.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:42.600
But that woman wants
to destroy this world.

00:18:42.666 --> 00:18:44.166
Destroy! Destroy!

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.300
You're lying!

00:18:45.533 --> 00:18:48.273
Why would she have to
do something like that?!

00:18:48.566 --> 00:18:50.166
Then what is that?!

00:18:51.633 --> 00:18:53.803
What's that Darkness
that she released?!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.000
Here they come!

00:19:09.466 --> 00:19:12.226
Lord Deathroy granted me Chimera.

00:19:12.833 --> 00:19:15.303
I'll defeat Zola with this power
no matter what!

00:19:15.733 --> 00:19:18.373
You guys better not
interfere at that time!

00:19:25.166 --> 00:19:26.326
Get away!

00:19:37.733 --> 00:19:39.233
Let's get out of here quick, maro!

00:19:39.566 --> 00:19:40.226
No!

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:41.270
Maro?!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.370
Come, Blue Dragon!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.270
Shu!

00:19:53.733 --> 00:19:57.833
Zola might not be
a Soldier of Light, but...

00:19:58.733 --> 00:20:01.433
Shu, believe in me.

00:20:02.766 --> 00:20:03.766
Zola...

00:20:04.433 --> 00:20:05.503
I'm sure Zola is...

00:20:07.033 --> 00:20:08.033
Damn it!

00:20:09.233 --> 00:20:10.733
Out of my way!

00:20:10.766 --> 00:20:11.896
You little!

00:20:13.533 --> 00:20:14.933
There's no end to these things!

00:20:15.366 --> 00:20:17.566
Stop whining, Blue Dragon!

00:20:17.933 --> 00:20:21.373
I'm not whining!
What's the matter with you, Shu?!

00:20:21.566 --> 00:20:23.566
You won't be able to use
your power if you cry!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.830
Cry? Me?!

00:20:41.566 --> 00:20:42.796
Shu, this way!

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:43.900
Hurry!

00:20:49.266 --> 00:20:50.896
We've just deciphered another text!

00:20:51.766 --> 00:20:52.766
It reads...

00:20:53.033 --> 00:20:55.033
Inside of the true Darkness...

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:57.830
Lies a true Shadow.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.570
We can't decipher any further here.

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.100
Engines at full speed!
Back to the base!

00:21:08.866 --> 00:21:10.166
Will we make it in time?

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.270
At this rate, the whole world will be
swallowed up by the Darkness.

00:21:19.333 --> 00:21:21.333
What do we do now?

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:25.570
For now, we need to keep our distance.
We need to get as far away as possible!

00:21:25.966 --> 00:21:28.126
And then what do we do after that?

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:29.870
Don't ask me!

00:21:30.266 --> 00:21:32.626
But... But...

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:35.570
Was Zola a bad person?!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.130
She may not be one of
the Soldiers of Light...

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.170
But Zola was a good person.

00:21:41.133 --> 00:21:45.433
She saved us so many times.
But was that...

00:21:46.133 --> 00:21:51.133
Hey, somebody tell me!
Did Zola deceive us?!

00:21:51.166 --> 00:21:54.296
No! There must be
some kind of reason!

00:21:54.333 --> 00:21:56.673
But what do we do about this reality?!

00:21:57.233 --> 00:21:59.103
With that thing spreading like that,

00:21:59.133 --> 00:22:01.903
the people all over the world
will be absorbed by the Darkness!

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:05.000
The whole world...in Darkness.

00:22:05.666 --> 00:22:07.996
I don't really get it, maro.

00:22:08.466 --> 00:22:13.596
But it would really suck if my Devee Village
got swallowed up by that, maro...

00:22:13.933 --> 00:22:14.933
No way.

00:22:15.533 --> 00:22:17.503
But...yeah...

00:22:18.033 --> 00:22:21.903
That will happen if the Darkness
continues to grow.

00:22:22.933 --> 00:22:26.173
If that was Zola's objective...

00:22:27.133 --> 00:22:28.203
No!

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:29.500
Shu...

00:22:30.233 --> 00:22:36.703
A world where Darkness rules...
That's my objective. It's what I wanted...

00:22:36.733 --> 00:22:40.273
No, that's not it!

00:24:17.866 --> 00:24:21.266
As the end of the world approaches,
Shu and the others come to a decision.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:23.230
Bouquet, marry me.

00:24:23.266 --> 00:24:25.296
Really? I'm so happy!

00:24:25.333 --> 00:24:28.273
I'll play the part of
Bouquet's dad, maro.

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:30.070
Right. I'm counting on you,
Marumaro.

00:24:30.100 --> 00:24:33.370
I won't give my daughter to
a slipshod man like you, maro.

00:24:33.600 --> 00:24:36.100
Next on Blue Dragon:
Quiver Quiver Boing!
